B.al_=s(["The monthly advance-expense summary now shows paid this month versus the total due through the selected month.","Each advance expense now shows paid versus due, with its date and a full-width progress bar in the collapsed card.","Removed the duplicate desktop language switcher and kept language settings in the account menu."],t.s)
